estment Management Indonesia to list on the Indonesia Stock Exchange (IDX), according to a notice published by the regulator. The funds will hold bitcoin directly, with custody at Bank Mandiri and PT Kustodian Sentral Efek Indonesia (KSEI), and are expected to begin trading on November 10. Retail investors will be able to buy them through ordinary brokerage accounts. The issuers told The Block they expect combined seed and first-month creations of about 3,500 BTC, all bought on the spot market through local and offshore exchanges. OJK took over crypto-asset supervision from Bappebti in January 2025 and opened a public consultation on crypto ETFs in March. An OJK official confirmed the approval to The Block.\",\"title\":\"Indonesia's OJK approves first spot bitcoin ETFs, two funds to list on IDX with 3,500 BTC seed\",\"url\":\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-10-21-indonesia-ojk-approves-first-spot-bitcoin-etfs-two-funds-to-list-on-idx-421186\"},\"message\":{\"item_id\":\"ITM-01M5DXR6RWRETE0QWPTFWZYS19\",\"kind\":\"NEW_ITEM\"}}", "type": "text"}], "type": "user.message"}, "last_payload": {"item_id": "ITM-01M5DXR6RWRETE0QWPTFWZYS19", "kind": "NEW_ITEM"}, "messages": ["32ea4b0ff3cdbbece12cccb6e8c80f44377f521814344707f1dd44ca66efd036"], "missing_fields": {}, "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_id_basis": "RESOLVED_SESSION_AGENT", "native_execution_receipts": {"sevt_-Au_ML3veFpdAN4QYN3xy": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_4db1c4a9d5b26a964f1aa79b2ceafbc4998674e8abef4c43aaa630d1eaa4ad01_0", "id": "sevt_-Au_ML3veFpdAN4QYN3xy", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T00:39:43.714Z", "stop_reason": {"event_ids": ["call_ddddaffdf9ab41b7976a20349d45598c|fc_043747ee298f3045016ad809cf199c8191b8b3365dbd03078c"], "type": "requires_action"}, "type": "session.status_idle"}, "sevt_2h0f3FMPjrcUYwmA_clH6": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_e6e031609cae085004c98cd5121c76a19e2bcd1c0d5910e86afe7a47ce7aa8b2_0", "id": "sevt_2h0f3FMPjrcUYwmA_clH6", "processed_at": "2026-10-21T00:39:49.037Z", "stop_reason":